<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>📈 Trend Stock Scanner — {{ trigger_date }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #1f4e78;
    --strong: #d62828;
    --notable: #f4a261;
    --watch: #6c757d;
    --bg: #f7f9fc;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --border: #e5eaf0;
    --text: #1f2937;
    --text-muted: #6b7280;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; padding: 32px 24px; background: var(--bg);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Pretendard", "맑은 고딕", sans-serif;
    color: var(--text); line-height: 1.55;
  }
  header { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 24px; }
  h1 { font-size: 28px; margin: 0 0 4px; color: var(--primary); }
  .meta { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .summary-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .card .label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }
  .card .value { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--primary); }
  .card.strong .value { color: var(--strong); }
  .card.notable .value { color: var(--notable); }
  .card.watch .value { color: var(--watch); }

  section { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  h2 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); }

  .momentum-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;
  }
  .momentum-card {
    background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 5px solid var(--watch);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px;
  }
  .momentum-card.strong { border-left-color: var(--strong); }
  .momentum-card.notable { border-left-color: var(--notable); }
  .momentum-card .header-row {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .momentum-card .stock-name { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; }
  .momentum-card .stock-code { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .momentum-card .score-badge {
    background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
  }
  .momentum-card.strong .score-badge { background: var(--strong); }
  .momentum-card.notable .score-badge { background: var(--notable); }
  .momentum-card .theme-tag {
    display: inline-block; background: #eaf2f8; color: var(--primary);
    padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .momentum-card .signals {
    display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .momentum-card .rationale {
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); background: #f8fafc; padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 6px; border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
  }
  .momentum-card .keywords { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 6px; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--card-bg); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
  thead th {
    background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
  }
  tbody td { padding: 8px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 13px; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: #f8fafc; }
  .num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  .download-btn {
    display: inline-block; background: var(--primary); color: white;
    padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
  }
  .download-btn:hover { background: #163d5e; }

  .disclaimer {
    margin-top: 36px; padding: 14px; background: #fff8e1; border-left: 4px solid #fbc02d;
    border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #5d4037;
  }

  .empty { text-align: center; padding: 40px; color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; }

  /* Home button */
  .home-bar {
    max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 16px;
  }
  .home-bar a {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 14px; background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
    transition: background .15s;
  }
  .home-bar a:hover { background: var(--primary); color: white; }

  /* Bottom navigation */
  .nav-footer {
    max-width: 1200px; margin: 30px auto 0;
    display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;
    padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav-footer a {
    padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav-footer .nav-home { background: var(--primary); color: white; border-color: var(--primary); }
  .nav-footer .nav-home:hover { background: #163d5e; }
  .nav-footer .nav-other { background: var(--card-bg); color: var(--primary); }
  .nav-footer .nav-other:hover { background: #eef2f7; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    body { padding: 16px 12px; }
    h1 { font-size: 22px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="home-bar">
  <a href="../index.html">← 아카이브 홈</a>
</div>

<header>
  <h1>📈 Trend Stock Scanner</h1>
  <div class="meta">트리거 일자: <strong>{{ trigger_date }}</strong> · 생성 시각: {{ generated_at }} · <a href="./dashboard.html" class="download-btn" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 12px; margin-left: 8px;">📊 대시보드</a> <a href="./{{ excel_filename }}" class="download-btn" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 12px; margin-left: 4px;">📥 Excel</a></div>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <section>
    <div class="summary-grid">
      <div class="card"><div class="label">트렌드 키워드</div><div class="value">{{ summary.trends_total }}</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="label">1차 통과 (지속상승)</div><div class="value">{{ summary.primary_total }}</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="label">2차 통과 (2배급증)</div><div class="value">{{ summary.secondary_total }}</div></div>
      <div class="card strong"><div class="label">🔴 강력주목</div><div class="value">{{ summary.strong }}</div></div>
      <div class="card notable"><div class="label">🟡 주목</div><div class="value">{{ summary.notable }}</div></div>
      <div class="card watch"><div class="label">⚪ 관찰</div><div class="value">{{ summary.watch }}</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>🎯 모멘텀 종합 분석 (트렌드 × 거래량)</h2>
    {% if momentum %}
      <div class="momentum-grid">
      {% for m in momentum %}
        <div class="momentum-card {% if m.classification == '🔴 강력주목' %}strong{% elif m.classification == '🟡 주목' %}notable{% endif %}">
          <div class="header-row">
            <div>
              <div class="stock-name">{{ m.name }} <span class="stock-code">({{ m.code }} · {{ m.market }})</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="score-badge">{{ m.classification }} · {{ m.momentum_score }}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="theme-tag">#{{ m.theme }}</div>
          <div class="signals">
            <span>📊 거래량 {{ m.volume_signal }}</span>
            <span>🔥 트렌드 {{ m.trend_signal }}</span>
            <span>🧩 밀집도 {{ m.theme_density }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rationale">{{ m.rationale }}</div>
          <div class="keywords">매칭 키워드: {{ m.matched_keywords }}</div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="empty">트렌드와 거래량이 동시 매칭되는 종목이 없습니다.</div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>📊 2차 스크리닝 통과 종목 (2주avg ÷ 2~4주avg ≥ 2배)</h2>
    {% if secondary %}
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>코드</th><th>종목명</th><th>시장</th><th class="num">종가</th>
          <th class="num">vol_4-8w</th><th class="num">vol_2-4w</th><th class="num">vol_2w</th>
          <th class="num">2w/4-8w</th><th class="num">2w/2-4w</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for r in secondary %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ r.code }}</td><td>{{ r.name }}</td><td>{{ r.market }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.close|int) if r.close else "-" }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.vol_4w_8w|int) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.vol_2w_4w|int) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.vol_2w|int) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(r.ratio_2w_over_4w8w) }}</td>
            <td class="num"><strong>{{ "%.2f"|format(r.ratio_2w_over_2w4w) }}</strong></td>
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    {% else %}
      <div class="empty">2차 통과 종목 없음</div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>📈 1차 스크리닝 통과 종목 (거래량 지속 상승)</h2>
    {% if primary %}
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>코드</th><th>종목명</th><th>시장</th><th class="num">종가</th>
          <th class="num">vol_4-8w</th><th class="num">vol_2-4w</th><th class="num">vol_2w</th>
          <th class="num">2w/4-8w</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for r in primary %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ r.code }}</td><td>{{ r.name }}</td><td>{{ r.market }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.close|int) if r.close else "-" }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.vol_4w_8w|int) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.vol_2w_4w|int) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.vol_2w|int) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(r.ratio_2w_over_4w8w) }}</td>
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    {% else %}
      <div class="empty">1차 통과 종목 없음</div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>🔥 트렌드 키워드 Top {{ trends|length }}</h2>
    {% if trends %}
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>키워드</th><th>출처</th><th>지역</th><th class="num">점수</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for t in trends %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
            <td><strong>{{ t.keyword }}</strong></td>
            <td>{{ t.source }}</td>
            <td>{{ t.region }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ t.score }}</td>
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    {% else %}
      <div class="empty">트렌드 키워드 수집 결과 없음</div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <div class="disclaimer">
    ⚠️ 본 결과물은 정보 제공 목적이며 투자 권유가 아닙니다. 트렌드 데이터는 후행 지표일 수 있으며,
    거래량 급증은 악재성 매도 신호일 수도 있습니다. 등락률·뉴스 등과 교차검증 후 의사결정하세요.
    모든 투자 판단과 책임은 본인에게 있습니다.
  </div>

</div>

<div class="nav-footer">
  <a href="../index.html" class="nav-home">🏠 아카이브 홈</a>
  <a href="./dashboard.html" class="nav-other">📊 대시보드</a>
  <a href="./{{ excel_filename }}" class="nav-other">📥 Excel 다운로드</a>
</div>

</body>
</html>
